      "H2_quality": "some rank r < full preserves eval-loss within 2%% of the full-Muon control over a short matched training window.",
      "H3_rho_monotone": "rho (fraction of the CONTROL arm's true update norm falling outside a rank-r random subspace) decreases as r grows -- a sanity check on the projection mechanism, not a kill criterion."
    },
    "arms": {
      "full": "control: standard full-rank Muon, no projection. Also the r=full sweep point by the exact orthogonal-equivariance identity (verified numerically in --selftest) -- aliased to control's own result, no separate run.",
