    },
    "eval_protocol": "one frozen held-out batch (EVAL_SEED, generated once, never drawn into the training stream); eval_loss measured before any step (eval_loss_first) and after the full warmup+timed window (eval_loss_last); identical model init and identical training-batch sequence reused across every arm.",
