      "eval_seed": 20260707,
      "projection_seed": 20260708
    },
    "scope_disclosures": [
      "projection subspace P is FIXED for the entire run (frozen at init) -- periodic subspace resampling / momentum rotation across subspace switches (the fuller production mechanism) is OUT OF SCOPE here; disclosed follow-on, not tested.",
